  "description": "<p>This feature service provides detailed geographic information on polling places for the city of Providence, Rhode Island, specifically for the year 2026. It is designed to assist election officials, voters, and civic planners by offering a comprehensive and up-to-date dataset of polling locations within Providence.<\/p>",
